        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Household Size in the UK: 1981 vs 2001</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề + Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GSfZdFZOWo4qLSxeFS1lCO9Wggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q7yOdt4LToqWMdxCuHXlFf1ogWe\">Đề b&agrave;i Household Size in the UK: 1981 vs 2001 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả một&nbsp;<strong>biểu đồ cột chồng</strong> về ph&acirc;n bố số lượng người trong c&aacute;c hộ gia đ&igrave;nh ở UK trong hai năm 1981 v&agrave; 2001.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AENmd32dPoMrGZxIEABlAuMdgLc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NXbwdzcICof5r9xsXWvlgfaUgCe\">Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; dạng bar chart c&oacute; số liệu thay đổi theo thời gian, n&ecirc;n overview ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh n&ecirc;n tập trung v&agrave;o:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UGyedqF1MoeUZrx1n2MlK0r9gKc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[Trend - xu hướng ch&iacute;nh]:</strong> C&oacute; sự chuyển dịch sang c&aacute;c hộ gia đ&igrave;nh nhỏ hơn (Hộ 1-2 người tăng, c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m c&ograve;n lại giảm)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CEf8dPQvboPhRkxLBwzlf2ipgAd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[So s&aacute;nh - lớn nhất/nhỏ nhất]: </strong>Hộ 2 người phổ biến nhất trong cả 2 năm</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng chia 2 đoạn BODY</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KEbNd18N4ojAdxx5thflzyGzgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TZqzdsBlpoQbCvxQuoZlAvyqgcb\">Ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể chia theo năm, BODY 1 so s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1981, BODY 2 tả sự thay đổi của từng nh&oacute;m ở năm 2001:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMfrdGasGoK0EwxiWNelUMO3g1Z\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[BODY 1]: </strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu năm 1981 (tất cả c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUNGdScLjoYDs4xmlXbl3CtKg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[BODY 2]: </strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi đến năm 2001 (tất cả c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Định hướng sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong từng BODY</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YWd1dsUwQoILZ1xijNxlMAK4gNP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XEbGdGyOZoLsUtx0D8Dlw41FgfF\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>[BODY 1]</strong>:</span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ITxIdrg9lobw5kxCtSplrx8eg9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ hộ 1 người (17%) với hộ 2 người (31%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JGRNd6xt0oGYz0xB01blerQ2gIh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) M&ocirc; tả tỷ lệ hộ 3 người (20%) v&agrave; 4 người (18%), v&agrave; m&ocirc; tả tỷ lệ hộ 5 người (8%) v&agrave; 6 người (6%)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QF3gd66HEoSxl2xhdcBlTzCogub\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>[BODY 2]</strong>:</span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GJg0d13xDoU3oMxNIDjlMInvgbr\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) M&ocirc; tả sự tăng nhẹ của hộ 2 người (tăng 3%), v&agrave; m&ocirc; tả sự tăng mạnh của hộ 1 người (tăng 9%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W3nbd5ZQoos1puxYqjylK0Nvgqh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) M&ocirc; tả sự giảm của hộ 3 v&agrave; 4 người (giảm 3%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ParRdOVMvodbPTxBduOleLD8gid\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 3) M&ocirc; tả sự suy giảm của hộ 5 v&agrave; 6 người (c&ograve;n 6% v&agrave; 2%)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Định hướng về cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C&aacute;c bạn c&oacute; thể tham khảo cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u sau đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\n<table class=\"ace-table\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"190;225;411\"><colgroup><col width=\"190\"><col width=\"225\"><col width=\"411\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EWJIdLeABo2J8KxBiralGbmugdh\"><strong>Chức năng</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NkaudH7eCoEjBsxTAhGlT5c2gch\"><strong>Cấu tr&uacute;c</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U6WNdmY1xo5vcUxu4K4l7PsVgEH\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ</strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZHKjdt3TBoMcoYxEcQwlbmhWgGb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ giữa c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RDvjd9Vegobe7qxKQjylYq9MgBb\">X-person households accounted for Y%, [so s&aacute;nh với] Z% for A-person households.</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NccmdLJLwolVrlxF3I8lQF6sgIf\">Single-person households accounted for 17%, only half of those with 2 residents, at 31%.</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KFtBdYgE3oGMH3xLyELlnlSlg8P\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Diễn đạt xu hướng tăng/giảm</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jq37dp3Z1otrgbx2QzlltYN1gqS\">The figure for X-person households increased/decreased by Y%.</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IQvtd2ApkoFXvPxOoxBlPs3wgVl\">The figure for two-person households increased slightly by 3%.</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QO9UdgarEo3koYxbOiflfyYFg1I\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Diễn đạt sự tăng mạnh</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VRtSda8o8o5aYRxahK0lEtIWgHf\">The proportion of X surged/rose dramatically by Y%.</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JZQ2d4ziOoJ2pfxUgaHlKZ7fgpe\">The proportion of single-person households surged by 9%.</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"4\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DDPxdgb2hoe1GKxEDialimeggOd\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>So s&aacute;nh nhiều nh&oacute;m c&ugrave;ng l&uacute;c</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CVzodBXsuoUDONxi0a6lz916gKf\">X and Y experienced a decline, falling to A% and B% respectively.</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KMXydKOiFoUf5fxkLMHlPE45g3d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Larger households, specifically those with 5 and 6 individuals, experienced a decline, falling to 6% and 2% respectively.</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
